# Assembler input and output from the CPU tests. These go to the build
# directory now, so they should never land here - but a test binary built
# before that change writes them relative to wherever it was run from, which
# is how a batch of them ended up committed. Anchored to the root, so that the
# assembly the demo tool takes as input is unaffected.
/*.asm
/*.com

